{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"edits\":[{\"path\":\"meaning_history/senses/0/text\",\"value_json\":\"\\\"Illness, sickness, or disease is a common present-day meaning. The earliest word sense remains disputed: 字源 proposes “serious illness,” Shuowen glosses 病 as illness worsening, and another study proposes hardship as the original meaning. These are competing analyses, not established stages in a single history.\\\"\"},{\"path\":\"meaning_history/senses/0/evidence_ids\",\"value_json\":\"[\\\"ref006\\\",\\\"ref038\\\",\\\"ref040\\\",\\\"ref047\\\",\\\"ref048\\\"]\"}]}"}}
